@backend_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### Root
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/

### Get current command (ESP32 polls this)
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/command
Accept: application/json

### Set AUTO mode
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/command/auto

### Set MANUAL mode (lampOn=true)
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/command/manual?lampOn=true

### Send telemetry (ESP32 -> backend)
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/telemetry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pir": true,
  "ldr": 1234,
  "lampOn": true,
  "mode": "manual",
  "uptimeMs": 424242
}

### Get latest telemetry
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/telemetry/latest
Accept: application/json

### Device status (latest telemetry + current command)
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/device/status
Accept: application/json

